<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK RESERVES RISE FIM 284 MLN IN WEEK.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK RESERVES RISE FIM 284 MLN IN WEEK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest</p>
<p>balance sheet for the week to September 6 showed the following</p>
<p>positions in millions of markka compared to August 30.</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 34,874	 34,590</p>
<p> Money market intervention    14,585	  9,988</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		6,297	  6,297</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 2,432	  2,435</p>
<p> Total assets		     66,181	 61,285</p>
<p>In the previous week, to August 30, reserves fell by 373</p>
<p>million markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
